2 CONT
2 CONT 8340230. Ingemund* SIGURDSON Skjervheim(892) (915)(767) was born about 1270 in Norway. He died after 1322 in Skjervheim gård #138, Vats, Rogaland, Norway. Ingemund Sigurdsson is named in 11 documents between 1306 and 1322. He was 
2 CONC a prominent citizen of Stavanger, served as a judge and was one of the King's personal retainers (hirdmann). Hirdmenn were normally very wealthy individuals from the best families. Ingemund resided at the estate of Skjervheim in V
2 CONC ats. Children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1041920 i. Sigurd* INGEMUNDSSON. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1042003 ii. Gyrid* INGEMUNDSDATTER.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
