1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bóndi á Fellsmúla í Landsveit til 1375. Árið 1379 var harður vetur á Íslandi og „[f]yrirgekk skip, er í var Ólafr bóndi Þorsteinsson ok margt fólk annat“, segir í Annálum. 
2 CONT _________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT A farmer at Fellsmúli in Landsveit, Rangárvallasýsla until 1375. In 1379, there was a harsh winter in Iceland and "[a] ship sailed and sunk, in which was Ólafr the farmer Þorsteinsson and many other people", says the Annals.
