1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Íslendingabók:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ásgeir Auðunsson Fæddur (955) Heimildir: Landnáma
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT =Source texts:
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Landnámabók
2 CONT https://www.snerpa.is/net/snorri/landnama.htm
2 CONT ===55. kafli 
2 CONT Hunda-Steinar hét jarl á Englandi; hann átti Álöfu, dóttur Ragnars loðbrókar. Þeirra börn voru þau Björn, faðir Auðunar skökuls, og Eiríkur, faðir Sigurðar bjóðaskalla, og Ísgerður, er átti Þórir jarl á Vermalandi.
2 CONT
2 CONT Auðun skökull fór til Íslands og nam Víðidal og bjó á Auðunarstöðum. Með (honum) kom út Þorgils gjallandi félagi hans, faðir Þórarins goða. Auðun skökull var faðir Þóru mosháls, móður Úlfhildar, móður Ástu, móður Óláfs konungs hin
2 CONC s helga. Son Auðunar skökuls var Ásgeir að Ásgeirsá; hann átti Jórunni, dóttur Ingimundar hins gamla. Þeirra börn voru þau Þorvaldur, faðir Döllu, móður Gissurar byskups, og Auðun, faðir Ásgeirs, föður Auðunar, föður Egils, er átt
2 CONC i Úlfheiði, dóttur Eyjólfs Guðmundarsonar, og var þeirra son Eyjólfur, er veginn var á alþingi, faðir Orms, kapalíns Þorláks byskups. Annar son Auðunar skökuls var Eysteinn, faðir Þorsteins, föður Helga, föður Þórorms, föður Odds,
2 CONC  föður Hallbjarnar, föður Sighvats prests. Dóttir Ásgeirs að Ásgeirsá var Þorbjörg bekkjarbót.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==The Book of Settlements: Landnámabók
2 CONT [https://books.google.com.au/books?id=jj6cIwMCZqIC&redir_esc=y Translated by Hermann Palsson]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===177. Audun skökull 
2 CONT
2 CONT There was a jarl in England called Hunda-Steinar. He married Álöf, Ragnar loðbrók’s daughter, and their children were Bjorn, father of Audun skökull, Eirik, father of Sigurd Bjodaskallo and Isgerd who married Earl Thorir of Vermal
2 CONC and.
2 CONT
2 CONT Audun skökull went to Iceland, tookk possession of Vididale and lived at Audunsstead. His comrade Thorgils Gjallandi, father of Thorarin the Priest, came to Iceland with him.
2 CONT
2 CONT Audun skökull was father of Thora Mosháls , mother of Ulfhild, mother of Asta, mother of King Olaf the Holy. Audun had a son called Asgier of Asgiers River, who married Jorunn, daughter of Ingimund the Old. Their children were Tho
2 CONC rvald, father of Dalla, mother of Bishop Gizur, and the Audun, father of Asgeir, father of Audun, father of Egil who married Ulfheid, daughter of Eyjolf Gudmundarson, and their son was Eyjolf, who was killed at the Althing, the fa
2 CONC ther of Bishop Thorlak’s chaplain, Orm. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Audun skökull had another son called Eystein, father of Thorstein, father of Helgi, father of Thororm, father of Odd, father of Halbjørn, father of Sigvat the Priest. Asgeir of Asgeirs River had a daughter Thorbjørg Bekkjarbót. 
