2 CONT Family: ridder van Rappard. Family: ridder Huyssen van Kattendijke. Family: ridder de van der Schueren. The title Ridder descends in two ways: "op allen" (to all - i.e. every descendant, male or female, in the male line, is entitl
2 CONC ed to the title) and "met het recht op eerstgeboorte" (with the right of the first-born - i.e. descent by Salic law, i.e. the eldest male descendant of the title's first bearer may take the title, but not the others).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ridder is a literal translation of Latin Eques and originally meant "horseman" or "rider".
