2 CONC nd had a son “[http://www.geni.com/people/Hakon-Karl/6000000017405867140?through=6000000017405673361  Hakon Karl]…[and] a farm at Paplay”[907]. [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc268450047 (Cawley's Medla
2 CONC nds)] 
