1 OCCU Skáld
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gunnlaug Ormstunga (tidigare också Gunnlög Ormtunga) (isl. Gunnlaugr ormstungu), född omkring 983, död 1008, var en isländsk kämpe och skald, huvudperson i Gunnlaug Ormstungas saga. Till sitt lynne var han alltifrå
2 CONC n ungdomen dristig och hetsig, modig och hårdför samt skicklig skald, helst då det gällde nidvisor, och han kallades därför Ormstunga
2 CONT
2 CONT http://cornelius.tacitus.nu/sagor/gunnlaug/7.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT When Gunnlaugr was eighteen, he went abroad. At that time, Helga became his fiancée, on the condition that she would wait no more than three years for Gunnlaugr. He visited Norway, England, Ireland, Orkney and Sweden. In Sweden, h
2 CONC e stayed with King Óláfr Skötkonung, and met his rival the Icelandic champion and skald Hrafn Önundarson
2 CONT
2 CONT It would take four years (1005) for Gunnlaugr to return to Iceland and Helga. Since Gunnlaugr had been gone longer than his allotted three years, Helga was forced into an unhappy marriage to Gunnlaugr's enemy Hrafn. Gunnlaugr and 
2 CONC Hrafn met at the althing of 1006 and Gunnlaugr challenged Hrafn to a holmgang. The duel ended in a draw, and was the last one allowed in Iceland. That day, holmganga were forbidden by law.
2 CONT
2 CONT In order to settle their dispute in blood, the two champions met in Norway, in the spring of 1008. There, Gunnlaugr defeated Hrafn, but was fatally wounded. After a short time, he died at age 25. Helga later remarried, but never r
2 CONC ecovered from Gunnlaugr's death. Her greatest pleasure was to rest her eyes on a sumptuous coat that Gunnlaugr had given her. One evening, she rested her head on her husband's shoulder, spread the coat in front of her, and watched
2 CONC  it for a while. Thereafter, she fell back into her husband's embrace and was dead.
2 CONT
2 CONT "The Story of Gunnlaugur the Worm-Tongue and Raven the Skald" Translated by Eiríkr Magnússon and William Morris Article from Nordisk Familjebok (in Swedish) on Projekt Runeberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Landnamabogen_1 (15)
2 CONT
2 CONT http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gunnlaug_Ormstunge
