2 NOTE Her er et billede af den rekonstruerede kirke i Kagssiarsuk - Thjolhildes kirke. Da jeg var der sidst i 70'erne var der kun ruiner, men for ikke så mange år siden blev kirken genskabt. Brattalhid som stedet hed på Erik den Rødes t
3 CONC id ligger lige over for Narsarsuak, hvor sydgrønlands lufthavn er. Denne by kan man lige se i baggrunden af billedet.
3 CONT
3 CONT
3 CONT
3 CONT Here is a picture of the reconstructed church in Kagssiarsuk - Thjolhildes church. When I was there in the late 70s there were only ruins, but not so many years ago, the church was restored. Brattalhid as the place was called Erik
3 CONC  the Red's time is over against Narsarsuak where South Greenland airport is. This city can just see in the background of the image.
