2 CONT — Eyjolf the Gray Thordarson — Gellir — Thorgils — Ari the Learned.[9] — Thorkel Kuggi Thordarson — Thorstein Kuggason (also late in Laxdæla saga)[8] — Thorhild Rjupa (the Ptarmigan), wife of Snorri — Thord Horsehead — Thorfinn Ka
2 CONC rlsefni the explorer to Vinland[10]
2 CONT
