1 OCCU Rejste til Island med Audur "den dypsindige"., Housewife
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Thorgerd Thorsteinsdotter (Þorgerðr Þorsteinsdóttir)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Þorgerðr Þorsteinsdóttir  Tilnavn / fordanskning: Thorgerd Thorsteinsdatter Lokalitet: Vestl. Island  Relationer: Datter af Thorstein Rød og Thurid. Gift med Dale-Koll. Deres børn var Høskuld og Gro. Senere gift med Eyvind Ilds sø
2 CONC n Herjolf, med hvem hun havde sønnen Rut. Kilder: Landnamabogen 82, 83, S105, S106 Noter:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Landnamabogen
2 CONT
2 CONT Landnamabok says:
2 CONT
2 CONT Chapter XVI. There was a man named Koll, the son of Vedrar (Wether) Grim, the son of Asi a hersir; he had the management of the affairs of Aud, and was most honoured by her. Koll married Thorgerd, daughter of Thorstein the Red. [.
2 CONC ..]
2 CONT
2 CONT Chapter XVIII. Koll took to himself the whole of Salmonriver-dale, all unto Hawkdale-river; he was called Koll o' Dales; he had for wife Thorgerd, the daughter of Thorstein the Red; their children were Hoskuld and Groa, whom Velei
2 CONC f the Old had for wife; also Thorkatla, whom Thorgeir the godi had for wife.  [...]
2 CONT
2 CONT Herjolf, the son of Eyvind 'Eld,' was the second husband of Thorgerd, the daughter of Thorstein the Red; their son was Hrut, to whom Hoskuld paid into his mother's inheritance the land of Combeness between Hawkdale-river and that 
2 CONC ridge which there runs down from the mountains into the sea. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.northvegr.org/sagas%20annd%20epics/miscellaneous/landnamabok/011.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Landnamabok says:
2 CONT
2 CONT Aud gave Thorhild, the daughter of Thorstein the Red, in marriage to Eystein 'Meinfret,' the son of Alf, in Osta; their son was Thord, the father of Kolbein, the father of Thord the Skald; also Alf o' Dales, who had for wife Halld
2 CONC is, the daughter of Erp, whose son was Snorri, the father of Thorgils, the son of Halla.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.northvegr.org/sagas%20annd%20epics/miscellaneous/landnamabok/011.html
