1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tilnavnet "keiliselgur" (?)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jón Ozur Hrollaugsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT MEDIEVAL LANDS
2 CONT
2 CONT [Ragnvald had three illegitimate children by unknown mistresses:]
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. [HROLLAUG . Orkneyinga Saga names “Hallad, Hrollaug and the youngest Einar” as “natural sons” of “Earl Rognwald”[172]. Snorre names "Hallad, the second Einar, the third Hrollaug" as the three sons of "Earl Ragnvald" by concubin
2 CONC es, adding that they were all "grown men" when their legitimate brothers were still children[173]. Orkneyinga Saga records that Ragnvald told his son Hrollaug that “your fate will take you to Iceland [where] you´ll have plenty of 
2 CONC descendants”[174]. His alleged descendants in Iceland shown below are as stated in Thorstein Side-Hallum's Saga and Flatey-book's St Olaf's Saga[175] but the accuracy of this information, which has not been corroborated in other s
2 CONC ources, is unknown. m ---. The name of Hrollaug´s wife is not known.] [Hrollaug & his wife had one child:]
2 CONT
2 CONT a) [JON Ozur . 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---. The name of Jon´s wife is not known.] 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Jon & his wife had one child:]
2 CONT
2 CONT i) [THOREY . 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---. The name of Thorey´s wife is not known.] [Thorey & his wife had one child:]
2 CONT
2 CONT (a) [HALL of Sida . m ---. The name of Hall´s wife is not known.] [Hall & his wife had two children:]
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) [THORSTEIN . Aged 20 at the battle of Clontarf 1014.
2 CONT
2 CONT (2) [THORDIS . Orkneyinga Saga records that “the mother of…Ospak was Thordis, daughter of Hall of Sida”[176]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---. The name of Thordis´s husband is not known.] Thordis & her husband had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT a. USPAK . Orkneyinga Saga records that “Earl Erlend Thorfinnson” married “Thora, the daughter of Sumarlidi Ospaksson”, adding that “the mother of…Ospak was Thordis, daughter of Hall of Sida”[177]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---. The name of Uspak´s wife is not known. Uspak & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT (i) SOMERLED . Orkneyinga Saga records that “Earl Erlend Thorfinnson” married “Thora, the daughter of Sumarlidi Ospaksson”[178]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---. The name of Somerled´s wife is not known. Somerled & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT (a) THORA . Orkneyinga Saga records that “Earl Erlend Thorfinnson” married “Thora, the daughter of Sumarlidi Ospaksson”, adding that “the mother of this Ospak was Thordis, daughter of Hall of Sida”[179]. Orkneyinga Saga records th
2 CONC at “his mother was married…to a man called Sigurd” when her son Magnus returned to Orkney, adding that she and her second husband had a son “Hakon Karl…[and] a farm at Paplay”[180]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly ERLEND Thorfinsson Jarl of Orkney, son of THORFINN "the Black" Jarl of Orkney & his wife Ingibjörg Finnsdatter (-in prison Nidaros 1098, bur Nidaros). 
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly SIGURD of Paplay .
2 CONT
2 CONT b) [HALLBERA . m ASBIORN, son of HRAFUNKEL of Steinrodar-Stadir in Iceland.]
