1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Thorgils Leifsson''' was born 1000 in the Hebrides islands, when he was old enough to leave home he was sent to Greenland to live with his father.
2 CONT
2 CONT Leif Eriksson traveled from Greenland to Norway in 999, he was blown off course to the Hebrides, staying for much of the summer. During his stay in the Hebrides, he fell in love with noblewoman Thorgunna who gave birth to their so
2 CONC n Thorgils. Thorgils was later sent to his father in Greenland.
2 CONT
