1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brief Life History of Aron
2 CONT When Aron Snorrasson was born in 1040, in Hrafnsfjarðareyri, Norđur-Ísafjarđarsýsla, Westfjords, Iceland, his father, Snorri Snorrason, was 13 and his mother, Mrs. Snorri Snorrason, was 13. He married Margrét Þórðardóttir in 1065,
2 CONC  in Hrafnsfjarðareyri, Norđur-Ísafjarđarsýsla, Westfjords, Iceland. They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. He died in 1090, in his hometown, at the age of 50.
2 CONT
