2 CONT Olov Eriksdtr Galtung married Viking Torgilsen ?, son of Torgils Tronsen Hundevåg. She was born before 1400.
2 CONT
2 CONT Viking Torgilsen ? died. He married Olov Eriksdtr Galtung, daughter of Erik Sigurdsen Galtung. He was born before 1371.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jorun Vikingsdtr ? married Bergulf Arnesen ?, son of Arne Amundsen Aga. She was born circa 1400. She is mentioned Kvinesdal.I. 391.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bergulf Arnesen ? married Jorun Vikingsdtr ?, daughter of Viking Torgilsen ? and Olov Eriksdtr Galtung. He was born
2 CONT
