1 NOTE     * OCCUPATION: Lendermann
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1140, Randaberg, Rogaland
2 CONT     * DEATH: 18 Jun 1179, Kalvskinnet, Trondheim 
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT http://home.online.no/~moerck/odin/818.html
