2 CONC ingsdatter Gjert Erlingsdaughter Lodin Erlingsson Sources: - family: Giskeætten paa Søndmør, s 2, Ålesund 1883, by Peder Fylling Tønsber Blad 13 / 10-1982, Over mountains and valley, by Finn Wang 
