2 CONT Noteringar I källan står:
2 CONT
2 CONT When Trygve was killed in 963, his wife, Astrid had to escape from Gunhild (King's mother). She came to Randsforden, hid there and bore a son that would become the famous King Olav Trygvasson. Astrid escapeed with him to Obrestad 
2 CONC on Jæren (Rogaland) with Gunhild's men in steady pursuit.
2 CONT
