1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Kristina Birgersdotter=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Jarl Birger Brosa Birgersson Skänkare & Brigida Haraldsdatter, daughter of Harald Gille of Norway.
2 CONT * KRISTINA .  Snorre names (in order) "Ingegerd who was married to the Swedish king Sorkver [and] second daughter Kristin and a third Margaret" as the daughters of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife Brigida Haraldsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Peter Israelsson (Finsta),''' son of Israel, stamfar Finsta
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Birger Persson Pettersson,''' born ca 1266, died on 1327-04-03 in Uppland, Sweden 
2 CONT * '''Israel Petersson (Finsta),''' died Nov of 1302 in Uppsala Sweden
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SWEDISH%20NOBILITY.htm#BirgerBrosadied1202 Projects MedLands Swedish Nobility]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''BIRGER "Brosa''' (-9 Jan 1202).  He is named as the son of Bengt in the 14th century Varnem Abbey genealogy[10].  Jarl in Sweden 1174.  “Byrgerus dux magnus et Karolus fratres eius” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/85] under 
2 CONC which “Kanutus…Rex Sweorum atque Gotthorum” donated property to the monks of Juleta kloster[11].  “…B. dux…M. frater ducis B et filius eius Eskillus…” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/99] under which “Kanutus…Sweorum rex” donate
2 CONC d property to the monks of Juleta kloster[12].  “Byrgo Sweorum et Guttorum dux…Philippus frater meus, Magnus et Karolus fratres ducis…” witnessed a charter dated to [1167/99] under which “K…Sweorum rex filius Herjcjs itjdem regis”
2 CONC  donated property to Nydala kloster[13].  The Saga of King Sverre records the death of "Earl Birgi Brosa" in the same year as Sverre King of Norway[14].  The Icelandic Annals record the death in 1202 of "Birgerus comes in Suecia"[
2 CONC 15].  '''married  (after 1161) as her third husband, BRIGIDA of Norway, widow firstly of KARL Sunasson Jarl in Västergötland, and secondly of MAGNUS Henriksson, King in Östergötland, daughter of HARALD "Gille" King of Norway & his
2 CONC  [first/second] wife'''  (-[Riseberga Abbey] 22 Oct ).  Snorre records that "King Harald Gille's daughter Brigida" was first married to "the Swedish king Inge Halsteinson, and afterwards to Earl Karl Sonason, and then to the Swedi
2 CONC sh king Magnus", noting that she and King Inge Haraldson were cousins by the mother's side, and "at last [she] married Earl Birger Brose"[16].  It is not chronologically possible for Brigida to have married Inge Halsteinson King o
2 CONC f Sweden, who died in 1118.  She must have been an infant at the time of her marriage to Karl Sunasson.  The Saga of King Sverre records that "Earl Birgi Brossa" had married "Brigit", the sister of King Sverre's father[17].
2 CONT
2 CONT =Birger & his wife Brigida  had seven children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''FILIP Birgersson''' (-killed in battle [Akerhus] 4 Jan 1200).  Snorre names (in order) "Earl Philip, Earl Knut, Folke and Magnus" as the four sons of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife[18].  Jarl in Sweden.  The Saga of King Sver
2 CONC re names "Philippus son of Earl Birgi" at a meeting of the Birkibeins at Borg
2 CONT * '''KNUT Birgersson''' (- killed in battle Lena 31 Jan 1208).  Snorre names (in order) "Earl Philip, Earl Knut, Folke and Magnus" as the four sons of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife[21].  Jarl in Sweden.  m ---.  The name of Knut´
2 CONC s wife is not known. 
2 CONT * '''INGEGÄRD Birgersdotter''' (- after 1210).  Snorre names (in order) "Ingegerd…married to the Swedish king Sorkver [and] a second daughter…Kristin and a third Margaret" as the daughters of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife[22].  m
2 CONC  as his second wife, SVERKER II Karlson "den yngre" King of Sweden, son of KARL I King of Sweden & his wife Christine Stigsdatter [Hvide] (-killed in battle Gestilren 17 Jul 1210, bur Alvastra Abbey). 
2 CONT * '''FOLKE Birgersson''' (- killed in battle Gestilren 17 Jul 1210).  Snorre names (in order) "Earl Philip, Earl Knut, Folke and Magnus" as the four sons of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife[23].  Jarl in Sweden.  m ---.  The name of
2 CONC  Folke´s wife is not known. 
2 CONT * '''MAGNUS Birgersson''' Snorre names (in order) "Earl Philip, Earl Knut, Folke and Magnus" as the four sons of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife
2 CONT * '''KRISTINA''' .  Snorre names (in order) "Ingegerd…married to the Swedish king Sorkver [and] a second daughter…Kristin and a third Margaret" as the daughters of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife[29]. 
2 CONT * '''MARGARETA''' .  Snorre names (in order) "Ingegerd…married to the Swedish king Sorkver [and] a second daughter…Kristin and a third Margaret" as the daughters of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife
2 CONT
