1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Helga var ekki eiginkona Jóns "eldri" Finnbogasonar, heldur var hún kona Jóns "langs" Finnbogasonar, bróður "Jóns "eldri". Húsfreyja í Hafrafellstungu, Þingeyjarsýslu. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Helga was not married to Jón "eldri" Finnbogason - she was married to "Jón "langur" Finnbogason, brother of Jón "eldri" (the older). She was a housewife at the farm Hafrafellstunga in Thingeyjarsysla, Northern Iceland.  
