2 CONT ''''''NORWAY, NOBILITY'''''' - http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORWEGIAN%20NOBILITY.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ERLING Skjalgsson (-killed in battle 21 Dec 1028).  Snorre names "Erling of Sole" as son of Thorolf "Skialg", son of Ogmund[16].  On his marriage, his brother-in-law invested him with the land north of Sognefjord and east of the L
2 CONC idandisnes.  m (Summer 996) ASTRID Trygvesdatter, daughter of TRYGVE Olavsson King in Vigen and Romerike [son of HARALD I "Hårfagre/Harfagri/Fairhair" King of Norway].  Snorre names Astrid, sister of King Olav Trygvason, and in a 
2 CONC later passage records her marriage "in Summer" with "Erling Skjalgson"[17].  Erling & his wife had five children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''''ASLAK Erlingsson ''''''(-1028).  Snorre names "Aslak, Skialg, Sigurd, Lodin, Thorer and Ragnhild" as the children of Erling & his wife[18].  From Sole.  m (1015) SIGURD Sveinsdatter, daughter of SVEIN Haakonsson Jarl in Norw
2 CONC ay & Holmfrid of Sweden .  Snorre records the marriage of "Gunhild, Earl Svein's daughter" and "Aslak, Erling's son"[19].  Aslak & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1-         SVEIN Askelsson.  m RAGNHILD Svendsdatter, illegitimate daughter of SVEND II Estridsen King of Denmark & his mistress ---.  She is named by Christiansen as the illegitimate daughter of King Svend, without citing the sou
2 CONC rce[20].  Svein & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)       KNUT Sveinsson .  From Sole.  [1100].  m RIMHILD, daughter of ---.  Knut & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT (1)       SVEN Knutsson or Rimhildsson.  1129.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2-     daughter.  m Laxe-PAL, son of ---.  Laxe-Pal & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)       HAAKON "Pungelta" .  Snorre names "Hakon Paulson Pulgelta…a daughter's son of Aslak, son of Erling Skjalgson of Sole, and cousin of Hakon Mage" when recording that he opposed the forces of Inge King of Norway [in 1138][2
2 CONC 1]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (b)       EINAR (-1155)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3-       daughter.  m ---
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''''SKJALG Erlingsson''''''(-10 Aug 1062).  Snorre names "Aslak, Skialg, Sigurd, Lodin, Thorer and Ragnhild" as the children of Erling & his wife[22]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''''SIGURD Erlingsson''''''Snorre names "Aslak, Skialg, Sigurd, Lodin, Thorer and Ragnhild" as the children of Erling & his wife[23]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''''LODIN Erlingsson'''(-after 1098).  Snorre names "Aslak, Skialg, Sigurd, Lodin, Thorer and Ragnhild as the children of Erling & his wife[24]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''''RAGNHILD Erlingsdatter''''''Snorre names "Aslak, Skialg, Sigurd, Lodin, Thorer and Ragnhild as the children of Erling & his wife, specifying that Ragnhild married Thorberg Arnason[25].  m THORBERG Arnesson of Giske, son of A
2 CONC RNE & his wife ---.
2 CONT
