2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: ?, wife of Tore Sæbjørnsson TORGILSDATTER b: ABT 1480 in Aga gård #64, Ullensvang, Hordaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 ?, wife of Sæbjørn Toresson JONSDATTER b: BEF 1515 in Augland gård #8, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
