1 OCCU Viking Chieftain / Jarl / King of Mann and the Isles, Hersir í Noregi., Herse i Sogn og Høvding på Suderøyene, Lord in Norway, lived in Romsdale, became lord of the Hebrides, emigrated about 890 from Norway, made Land in Scotland,
