2 CONT * [https://nn.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olve_p%C3%A5_Egge '''Olve på Egge ( Ölvir á Eggju ) from the farm Egge was one of the leaders of the blotti'''ng on Mære .'''] He was married to Sigrid Toresdotter , sister of Tore Hund in Bjarkø
2 CONC y .''' Snorri Sturlason tells in Soga om Olav den Heilage about the dispute between Olve and Olav Haraldsson . When Olav Haraldsson surprisingly appeared on the midsummer beach on Mære, Olve was arrested and killed on Olav's order
2 CONC s.
