1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Orm Sveinsson Kyrpinga-Orm=
2 CONT
2 CONT * The family descended from Erlend av Gerde (Gjerde in Etne), who was one of the farmers' leaders in the Battle of Stiklestad in 1030. Erlend's grandson was the employed lieutenant Orm Sveinsson (Kyrpinga-Orm). Orm's son Erling Sk
2 CONC akke married Sigurd Jorsalfare's daughter Kristin, and he was the father of King Magnus Erlingsson . Both Kyrpinga-Orm and Erling Skakke lived in Stødle.
2 CONT * Orm "Kyrpinge-Orm" as he was named after the farm Kyrping in Etne in Sunnhordland, was the grandson of the lieutenant Erlend from Gjerde
2 CONT * Orm, was the foster father of the king's son Magnus Haraldsson 
2 CONT * Orm Svenson in Korpinge, called Korpinge-Orm; Länes-Höfdinge in Norway. - Married to Drottning Ragnild; daughter of a rich Länes-Höfdinge in Wiken (Bohus län) Sverker Stjernardsson and widow of King Magnus Håkansson in Norway. 
2 CONT * [http://runeberg.org/anrep/3/0375.html '''von Nackreij - Skytte, Volume 3, page 371''']
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORWAY.htm#ErlingOrmsenMKristinSigurdsdatter Project MedLands, NORWAY KINGS]
