2 CONT Ross, David: ‘Ancient Scotland’, Geddes & Grosset, Scotland 2004.  _____________
2 CONT
2 CONT Duncan and Grelad had one daughter, Groa. She married Thorfinn Hausakljufr (the skullsplitter), Earl of Orkney. Thorfinn succeeded as Mormaer of Caithness. After this, the Mormaerdom of Caithness was in the hands of the norse Earl
2 CONC s of Orkney. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Skuli Thorfinnsson, son of Thorfinn and grandson of Duncan had the mormaership of Caithness confirmed by King Kenneth II of Alba.
