1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''Landnámabók'' (the Book of Settlements) states that Thorir married "Ingibjörgu", daughter of "Gils skeiðarnefs" and they had a son named "'''Guðmundur'''".  ''Þorskfirðinga saga'', also known as ''Gull-Þóris saga
2 CONC '' (Gold-Thorir's Saga) gives the same family structure but names Thorir's wife as "Ingibjargar", daughter of "Gisl / Gilli" from "Kleifa". 
