0 @N6000000007329706237@ NOTE SOURCE: Wurts, John S., Magna Charta: Pedigrees  of the Barons,
1 CONT Philadelphia, PA: Brookfield Publishing Co, 1942.
1 CONT Kilde: parents: [Ref: Wurts p421]  Kilde: names: [Ref: Wurts p421]
1 CONT Kilde: date: [Ref: Wurts p421]  [Tom Bjornstad, <elcontob -at-
1 CONT telepost.no>] ...Ragnvald Morejarl   (or  Rannald or Reginald, Earl of
