1 CONT He was known for his size, strength, beauty and courage.  He was a viking who plundered in both the east and the west.  In 994 he was christened.  In 995 he became King and started to spread Christianity in his country.  He founde
1 CONC d Nidaros (Trondhjem) in 997.  In the year 1000, on his way home from Pomerania, he was attacked by the Norwegian Eirik Jarl and King Olov Sk¿tkonung of Sweden and King Sven Twobeard of Denmark.  He died at the sea battle of Svold
1 CONC er.
